=You are given a shortlist of REAL US universities (with official government facts already attached). Research scholarships, aid and admission details for each, for THIS student.

Student profile:
Target Program: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Target Program'] }}
Level of Education: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Level of Education'] }}
GPA / CGPA: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['GPA / CGPA'] }}
Percentage: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Percentage'] }}
Annual Family Income: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Annual Family Income'] }}
SAT Score provided: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['SAT Score'] || 'None — student did NOT provide SAT' }}
English Proficiency Test: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['English Proficiency Test'] || 'None' }}
English Test Score: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['English Test Score'] || 'Not provided' }}
Applying for Financial Aid/Scholarship: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Applying for Financial Aid/Scholarship?'] }}

UNIVERSITIES (JSON — research these exact schools, keep the same university_name):
{{ JSON.stringify($json.universities) }}

Return one enrichment object per university in the same order.

=Write clear, complete, beginner-friendly guides for an international student applying to US universities.

Target Program: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Target Program'] }}
Level of Education: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['Level of Education'] }}
English Proficiency Test: {{ $('Lead Intake Form').item.json['English Proficiency Test'] || 'None' }}

Produce application_guide, visa_guide and visa_interview_prep. Respond strictly in the required structured JSON format.

